    <note id="bhcm">
      <content>
        <p>The accepted raw_random_b11 arm is reused from independently verified RK39.</p>
        <p>Two primary families each require positive CI lower bounds, Holm significance, and positive effects for all three seeds.</p>
        <p>Long-budget interactions and external initialization are diagnostic, not confirmatory rescue.</p>
        <p>Native calibration and external initialization are prohibited from independent common-input claims.</p>
        <p>Source: RK40 independent ae5b90d0ac3c · clean closeout 7ddf1dab2bfaa92e.</p>
        <p>Independent verification: 5,031 checks; clean closeout: 948 checks; full project tests: 484 passed.</p>
        <p>Trajectories: 1,188 / 1,188 prefix checks PASS. Inference: &gt;20,000 paired evaluations plus 1,188 prefix checks.</p>
        <p>Native calibration and external initialization are search diagnostics; independent common-input/SOTA remains unresolved.</p>
      </content>
    </note>
